WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.750 --> 00:00:02.789
Connected to a panther goddess.

00:00:02.789 --> 00:00:04.220
Immunity to magic.

00:00:04.360 --> 00:00:07.030
The Black Panther is even cooler than you
think!

00:00:07.030 --> 00:00:08.480
Here's everything you need to know.

00:00:09.168 --> 00:00:13.570
Technically, Black Panther is not a single
person, but rather a title that has been passed

00:00:13.570 --> 00:00:15.570
down through the monarchy of Wakanda.

00:00:15.570 --> 00:00:19.810
The incumbent is also the leader of the Panther
Tribe and is tasked with protecting their

00:00:19.810 --> 00:00:22.359
country and people from all threats.

00:00:22.359 --> 00:00:26.789
While the role is hereditary, that doesn't
mean that the heir to the throne is guaranteed

00:00:26.789 --> 00:00:31.290
to become a Black Panther, as they must first
prove they are worthy of taking up the mantle.

00:00:31.290 --> 00:00:37.450
Two of the first Black Panthers included the
legendary Bashenga and his predecessor, Mosi,

00:00:37.450 --> 00:00:42.660
who ruled Wakanda in the 8th century B.C.
and 1,000,000 B.C respectively.

00:00:42.660 --> 00:00:46.790
The character most commonly associated with
the Black Panther moniker is T'Challa, the

00:00:46.790 --> 00:00:48.020
son of T'Chaka.

00:00:48.020 --> 00:00:52.540
He ends up becoming a hero not just for Wakanda
but for the entire world, fighting alongside

00:00:52.540 --> 00:00:57.440
superhero teams such as the Avengers and the
Fantastic Four while revealing his home nation

00:00:57.440 --> 00:00:58.580
to other countries.

00:00:59.139 --> 00:01:04.330
In both his movie form as part of the MCU
and the comics, Black Panther has a range

00:01:04.330 --> 00:01:07.950
of skills and abilities that make him a challenging
adversary.

00:01:07.950 --> 00:01:11.750
He is capable of fighting the Winter Soldier
and holding his own in the battle.

00:01:11.750 --> 00:01:16.470
His powers can largely be equated to the effects
of the Super Soldier Serum, making him as

00:01:16.470 --> 00:01:20.020
strong and durable as characters like Captain
America.

00:01:20.381 --> 00:01:22.611
"Move, Captain.

00:01:23.153 --> 00:01:25.690
I won't ask a second time."

00:01:25.690 --> 00:01:29.880
According to the "Official Handbook of the
Marvel Universe #2," the hero is stronger

00:01:29.880 --> 00:01:35.619
than any standard human and easily able to
outclass Olympic-level athletes in strength

00:01:35.619 --> 00:01:37.000
and speed challenges.

00:01:37.000 --> 00:01:42.909
He can lift more than four times his own body
weight, run at speeds exceeding 40 mph, and

00:01:42.909 --> 00:01:47.689
sustain strenuous physical activity for hours
on end without being fatigued.

00:01:47.689 --> 00:01:52.119
He is essentially at the peak of human condition
for all of these attributes so that he can

00:01:52.119 --> 00:01:56.250
pull off impressive feats like being able
to hold his breath for almost 10 minutes or

00:01:56.250 --> 00:01:58.799
leap across entire buildings.

00:01:58.799 --> 00:02:03.159
All of these abilities come together to make
T'Challa one of the best hand-to-hand fighters

00:02:03.159 --> 00:02:08.160
in the entire Marvel universe, often cited
in the top 10 alongside the likes of Wolverine

00:02:08.160 --> 00:02:09.629
and Iron Fist.

00:02:10.000 --> 00:02:11.281
"Come on.

00:02:11.910 --> 00:02:12.910
Really?"

00:02:13.470 --> 00:02:18.288
Another aspect that was powered up by eating
the Heart-Shaped Herb was Black Panther's senses.

00:02:18.288 --> 00:02:22.730
All of his mental faculties and senses have
been heightened as a result of his connection

00:02:22.730 --> 00:02:25.970
to the Panther Goddess Bast, who acts as his
patron.

00:02:25.970 --> 00:02:30.500
Though his senses are not quite as powerful
as other heroes, such as Daredevil, they have

00:02:30.500 --> 00:02:32.690
impressive practical uses.

00:02:32.690 --> 00:02:37.780
For example, his sense of smell can distinguish
between hundreds of people and even hunt them

00:02:37.780 --> 00:02:39.090
using their scent.

00:02:39.090 --> 00:02:44.140
"Black Panther" Vol 3 #25 states that he can
pick up the scent of someone he is tracking

00:02:44.140 --> 00:02:49.220
and follow them across vast distances, as
well as being able to memorize and recognize

00:02:49.220 --> 00:02:51.860
individuals from their smell alone.

00:02:51.860 --> 00:02:56.170
From a person's body odor he can even tell
if they are afraid or lying.

00:02:56.170 --> 00:03:00.900
Along with the capacity to see more clearly,
including in the infrared and electromagnetic

00:03:00.900 --> 00:03:05.659
spectrums, Black Panther can pick out individual
ingredients in the food that he eats.

00:03:05.659 --> 00:03:09.980
All of this makes him a formidable opponent
when it comes to trying to escape from or

00:03:09.980 --> 00:03:15.172
deceive him, as the augmented senses give
T'Challa a massive advantage.

00:03:15.359 --> 00:03:20.420
Although T'Challa is undoubtedly well-trained
and naturally talented, the source of most

00:03:20.420 --> 00:03:23.610
of his powers is the Panther Goddess known
as Bast.

00:03:23.610 --> 00:03:28.648
This deity has long been associated with the
country of Wakanda and the Panther Tribe in particular.

00:03:28.648 --> 00:03:32.870
According to the official Marvel site, the
god is inspired by deities from the Egyptian

00:03:32.870 --> 00:03:37.420
pantheon and in the fictional history of the
comics was first worshiped in the country

00:03:37.420 --> 00:03:40.549
along with her father, Ra, and sister Sekhmet.

00:03:40.549 --> 00:03:45.720
After several thousand years, Bast and Sekhmet
began to be worshiped in Wakanda and bestowed

00:03:45.720 --> 00:03:48.720
their blessings on those deemed worthy.

00:03:48.720 --> 00:03:53.290
Bast's blessing is most closely associated
with the Black Panthers, who lead the official

00:03:53.290 --> 00:03:55.010
state religion of Wakanda.

00:03:55.010 --> 00:03:59.280
The Panther Cult first emerged when Bashenga
fought against the mutated Wakandans who had

00:03:59.280 --> 00:04:02.680
been transformed by the vibranium meteor that
hit the land.

00:04:02.680 --> 00:04:07.310
He was made into an avatar of the Panther
God to aid his cause, and this connection

00:04:07.310 --> 00:04:11.400
to Bast allowed the Black Panthers to rule
Wakanda for generations.

00:04:11.400 --> 00:04:15.819
The descendants of Bashenga have subsequently
sought the favor of Bast so that they themselves

00:04:15.819 --> 00:04:18.450
can have the power and authority to lead.

00:04:18.988 --> 00:04:23.600
As part of the process of becoming a Black
Panther and gaining the blessing of Bast,

00:04:23.600 --> 00:04:26.600
individuals have to go through a series of
dangerous trials.

00:04:26.600 --> 00:04:30.820
This ranges from challenging the incumbent
Black Panther if they are still alive as well

00:04:30.820 --> 00:04:33.710
as fighting warriors from the tribes in Wakanda.

00:04:33.710 --> 00:04:38.360
Only someone who is capable of beating all
of these opponents is deemed worthy, although

00:04:38.360 --> 00:04:41.830
there are also other trials that must be completed
as well.

00:04:41.830 --> 00:04:46.310
"Justice will come soon enough."

00:04:46.310 --> 00:04:51.989
The final step to becoming a Black Panther
is to consume the mystical and rare Heart-Shaped Herb.

00:04:51.989 --> 00:04:56.190
This plant is said to be a gift from the Panther
Goddess herself but is actually the result

00:04:56.190 --> 00:05:00.690
of the vibranium meteorite that hit Wakanda
during prehistoric times, causing radiation

00:05:00.690 --> 00:05:04.050
to mutate and drastically change all life
around it.

00:05:04.050 --> 00:05:08.130
A solution is made using the plant that is
then applied to the body of the prospective

00:05:08.130 --> 00:05:10.820
Black Panther, which can also be consumed.

00:05:10.820 --> 00:05:15.220
However, the Heart-Shaped Herb is dangerous
in its own right and capable of killing those

00:05:15.220 --> 00:05:19.320
who come into contact with it if they don't
have the protection that Bast offers.

00:05:20.320 --> 00:05:23.740
Healing factors are not rare in the world
of Marvel Comics.

00:05:23.740 --> 00:05:28.110
Most fans will know of Wolverine's ability
to repair himself after sustaining incredible

00:05:28.110 --> 00:05:32.950
amounts of damage, in some cases even recovering
from his body being completely destroyed.

00:05:32.950 --> 00:05:37.270
In fact, the idea of super healing has become
something of a trope in the fictional universe

00:05:37.270 --> 00:05:42.130
that Marvel has created, with the likes of
Blade, Deadpool, and the Hulk all demonstrating

00:05:42.130 --> 00:05:45.550
an ability to heal much faster than normal
humans can.

00:05:45.550 --> 00:05:49.539
T'Challa doesn't have as potent a healing
factor as many other Marvel characters, but

00:05:49.539 --> 00:05:53.360
he is still capable of healing from minor
injuries at a rapid rate.

00:05:53.360 --> 00:05:58.009
As well as providing some immunity to diseases
and poisons, it means that small wounds and

00:05:58.009 --> 00:06:01.020
scrapes won't keep him out of action when
in a fight.

00:06:01.020 --> 00:06:05.770
Killing Black Panther is extremely difficult,
and only serious injuries would ensure that

00:06:05.770 --> 00:06:07.599
he can't get back up to fight.

00:06:07.599 --> 00:06:12.139
Like many of his other powers, this healing
factor manifested after he consumed the mystical

00:06:12.139 --> 00:06:13.139
Heart-Shaped Herb.

00:06:13.989 --> 00:06:18.800
As the king of Wakanda, T'Challa has access
to a vast amount of wealth.

00:06:18.800 --> 00:06:24.300
Fandom suggests that the hero may well be
the richest superhero in comic book history.

00:06:24.300 --> 00:06:30.160
His fortune largely comes from Wakanda itself,
a rich and thriving nation that has huge reserves

00:06:30.160 --> 00:06:31.220
of vibranium.

00:06:31.220 --> 00:06:35.461
The impressive effects of the ore have made
it much sought-after, and Black Panther's

00:06:35.461 --> 00:06:40.288
wealth dwarfs that of other rich heroes, such
as Iron Man.

00:06:40.288 --> 00:06:41.499
"Me?"

00:06:41.780 --> 00:06:47.789
The country has national reserves in the trillions
of dollars, and it has diversified its investments

00:06:47.789 --> 00:06:51.120
so that it doesn't have to rely solely on
vibranium for its wealth.

00:06:51.120 --> 00:06:55.069
Shut off from the rest of the world, Wakanda
was largely untouched by the troubles of the

00:06:55.069 --> 00:06:58.930
world throughout its history and has become
the most advanced nation in the world due

00:06:58.930 --> 00:07:00.280
to its technology.

00:07:00.280 --> 00:07:05.639
The effect of this incredible wealth and technology
is that the king has access to the very best

00:07:05.639 --> 00:07:07.800
training facilities and equipment.

00:07:07.800 --> 00:07:13.060
This allows him to hone his skills to perfection
and ensures that he only gets the best, including

00:07:13.060 --> 00:07:16.669
his gadgets and the vibranium-laced suit he
takes into battle.

00:07:16.669 --> 00:07:21.250
His decision to open Wakanda up to the world
has also brought him strong allies and increased

00:07:21.250 --> 00:07:23.512
diplomatic relations with other nations.

00:07:23.669 --> 00:07:28.710
The suit that Black Panther wears, officially
known as the Panther Habit, also boosts many

00:07:28.710 --> 00:07:30.270
of his innate abilities.

00:07:30.270 --> 00:07:34.520
Made with vibranium, the same material used
in the construction of Captain America's shield,

00:07:34.520 --> 00:07:37.750
it makes the wearer invulnerable to many types
of damage.

00:07:37.750 --> 00:07:42.310
It can even absorb the impact of gunshots
at close range and other powerful attacks.

00:07:42.310 --> 00:07:47.330
The movie version of the high-tech suit comes
with retractable vibranium claws for close-quarters

00:07:47.330 --> 00:07:51.879
combat and is made lightweight so that it
doesn't restrict the hero's movements.

00:07:51.879 --> 00:07:56.970
In battle, it is also able to absorb kinetic
energy and disperse it to augment Black Panther's

00:07:56.970 --> 00:07:58.639
own physical attacks.

00:07:58.639 --> 00:08:03.330
His special outfit can operate in a similar
manner to Spider-Man's, allowing him to grip

00:08:03.330 --> 00:08:07.120
walls and climb buildings that would otherwise
be impossible to mount.

00:08:07.120 --> 00:08:12.860
The suit also gives Black Panther an advanced
cloaking ability that can make him practically invisible.

00:08:12.860 --> 00:08:17.400
The technology is especially useful when it
comes to stealthily avoiding detection and

00:08:17.400 --> 00:08:19.270
infiltrating enemy headquarters.

00:08:19.270 --> 00:08:24.550
His boots can also allow him to drop from
great heights unharmed or leap long distances

00:08:24.550 --> 00:08:26.270
with grace and ease.

00:08:26.768 --> 00:08:31.030
Fans who know of Black Panther from the MCU
films might not be aware that the character

00:08:31.030 --> 00:08:34.159
is as impressive an intellect as he is a fighter.

00:08:34.159 --> 00:08:38.380
But it's true — Black Panther could even
be compared to the likes of Batman from DC

00:08:38.380 --> 00:08:39.880
Comics in terms of intelligence.

00:08:39.880 --> 00:08:43.990
He's a character who is capable of outthinking
his opponents as well as overwhelming them

00:08:43.990 --> 00:08:45.050
in battle.

00:08:45.050 --> 00:08:50.340
"Incredible Hulk" #601 noted that he has considered
among the smartest people living on the planet,

00:08:50.340 --> 00:08:55.300
while "Fantastic Four" #608 demonstrated that
only Reed Richards was able to keep up with

00:08:55.300 --> 00:08:56.300
him mentally.

00:08:56.300 --> 00:09:01.190
The "Official Handbook of the Marvel Universe
Master Edition #9" even reveals that he has

00:09:01.190 --> 00:09:05.959
something of a photographic memory and can
replicate almost any technology that he is

00:09:05.959 --> 00:09:09.163
given the chance to study even briefly.

00:09:09.378 --> 00:09:14.250
Along with his resistance to disease and poison
thanks to the power of the Heart-Shaped Herb

00:09:14.250 --> 00:09:19.170
and the blessing of Bast, Black Panther has
also acquired protection against magic.

00:09:19.170 --> 00:09:23.610
This happened during the "Doomwar" series,
when Doctor Doom was able to effectively remove

00:09:23.610 --> 00:09:28.310
all of T'Challa's powers and force the mantle
of Black Panther to be passed on to T'Challa's

00:09:28.310 --> 00:09:29.390
sister, Shuri.

00:09:29.390 --> 00:09:33.620
Doom himself even tries to prove his worthiness
to Bast at one point to try and become the

00:09:33.620 --> 00:09:34.880
leader of Wakanda.

00:09:34.880 --> 00:09:39.410
In an effort to get back his powers by other
means, T'Challa worked with the sorcerer Zawavari

00:09:39.410 --> 00:09:42.690
to restore many of T'Challa's abilities as
well as some new ones.

00:09:42.690 --> 00:09:47.420
Chief among them was resistance to almost
all forms of magic, making mystical attacks

00:09:47.420 --> 00:09:49.959
almost useless against Black Panther.

00:09:50.618 --> 00:09:55.300
As well as his arsenal of abilities and powers
most people are familiar with, there are a

00:09:55.300 --> 00:10:00.550
few less well-known examples that many fans
will be completely unaware of.

00:10:00.550 --> 00:10:06.030
One of the stranger powers that T'Challa has
demonstrated during his long history includes necromancy.

00:10:06.030 --> 00:10:12.190
"Secret Wars" #7, which was released in 2015,
sees the King of Wakanda work with Namor and

00:10:12.190 --> 00:10:16.910
Reed Richards to raise an army of zombies
to fight against Victor von Doom after striking

00:10:16.910 --> 00:10:18.520
a deal with the Panther Goddess.

00:10:18.520 --> 00:10:23.270
The deity gives the hero the ability to communicate
with the dead and raise them as soldiers to

00:10:23.270 --> 00:10:24.660
fight on his behalf.

00:10:24.660 --> 00:10:29.809
T'Challa becomes one of several Marvel characters
who've had a brush with the undead in the comics.

00:10:29.809 --> 00:10:33.850
The Heart-Shaped Herb that T'Challa had to
eat as part of the ritual to become Black

00:10:33.850 --> 00:10:37.470
Panther also allows him to communicate with
his ancestors in the afterlife.

00:10:37.470 --> 00:10:41.500
Other examples have been powers that Black
Panther has only possessed for a short amount

00:10:41.500 --> 00:10:43.769
of time or in one-off stories.

00:10:43.769 --> 00:10:49.019
In "Incredible Hulk" #601, he uses a teleportation
device that he has created himself to travel

00:10:49.019 --> 00:10:51.209
large distances instantaneously.

00:10:51.209 --> 00:10:56.029
Meanwhile, one storyline saw the hero able
to exercise clairvoyance, so that he could

00:10:56.029 --> 00:10:59.311
see into the future and witness events yet
to occur.

